The ported code is in src/import/: the list of Chromium-family browsers and
where each keeps its profiles and its cookie key, the decryption constants and
steps for Chromium cookie databases on Linux and macOS, and the flow that ranks
profiles holding a live session and tries them one at a time. It was rewritten
in TypeScript for AnkiWeb, so it is a modified version of the original.
